        "notes": "The game does not contain any sexual or nudity-related content.\r\n\r\nIt features violent combat with blood effects and dismemberment. However, there are no depictions of internal organs or excessive gore. Blood appears as dark red splatter during combat and may remain on walls or the environment.\r\n\r\nPlayers can disable gore via a \u201cGore\u201d checkbox in the game settings. When gore is disabled, dismemberment is turned off and blood effects are replaced with colorful, non-realistic visual effects (e.g. fireworks-style bursts).\r\n\r\nThe game also provides visual examples comparing the gore on/off setting for clarity.\r\n\r\n"
    },
